  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The rendering engine behind OHIF Viewers — MIT, OHIF foundation governance, 1.1k stars, actively maintained (v4.16.0, February 2026). Assess rather than Adopt because it is a developer framework rather than a deployable application; teams integrating medical imaging into custom web apps will need it, but end users reach it indirectly via OHIF Viewers (already Adopt).",
